



  ┌─ Move the branch and write the tree over ────────────────┐
  │ main moves to a1b2c3d, and the working tree is written   │
  │ over with it.                                            │
  │                                                          │
  │ ✕ every change of the working tree and of the index      │
  │                                                          │
  │ runs                                                     │
  │ git reset --hard -- a1b2c3d                              │
  │                                                          │
  │ type main to go on                                       │
  │ ›                                                      ▌ │
  │                                                          │
  │  enter run it  esc cancel                                │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘




